    's9' => [
        'paras' => [
            'Your journey contains 90 daily lessons. Each offers a brief insight, one small action and an optional reflection. The learning activities help you notice what fits in ordinary situations and keep useful observations together. They are not a growing list of habits you must maintain.',
            'Alongside that learning, keep one chosen wellbeing habit that feels manageable and relevant. Try it in the circumstances where it fits, notice what happens and adjust when needed. You can keep it, make it smaller, change it, pause it or stop it through the existing controls.',
