        'step3_heading' => 'Step 3: Know where to turn',
        'step3' => 'Some situations need more help than an everyday activity can provide. Consider an appropriate professional service or support route for what is happening. When personal contact is available and safe, it may be one option; it is never a condition for using this guide or obtaining specialist help.',
