    's11' => [
        'paras' => [
            'Your wellbeing is something you can keep understanding and supporting over time. During the journey, you will have opportunities to notice responses, explore manageable activities and review what fits your circumstances. You can build on what helps, revise a choice or leave an option that is not useful for you.',
            'The monthly reviews and closing days offer points to consider your chosen practice, preferences and useful resources. You do not need a particular pattern of progress to make that reflection worthwhile.',
