    's12' => [
        'paras' => [
            'Your Wellbeing Profile is part of Tools for the Tough Days. This report brings together the questionnaire answers you chose to share and offers reflections and practical possibilities for everyday wellbeing. It is designed for adults aged 18 years and over.',
            'The report is for self-reflection and learning. It is not a psychological assessment, diagnosis, treatment plan or clinical safety plan, and it does not replace professional mental health care. A result or character description does not explain your history, establish a condition or predict how you will respond in every situation.',
            'If you are concerned about your mental health or need additional support, consider an appropriate qualified health professional. The platform is not a crisis or emergency service and does not monitor your safety. In an Australian emergency, call 000. Crisis and specialist support options are provided in the separate support area and in Section 10.',
            'Your report reflects saved information available for this questionnaire run. Missing information is not treated as a negative answer, and a revised answer may change relevant report wording. Your choices about character language, personal support and reminders remain separate from questionnaire scores.',
